Avocado Egg Salad
Ingredients:

2 hard-boiled eggs
1 ripe avocado
Salt, pepper, and lemon juice to taste
Instructions: Mash the avocado and eggs together, season with salt, pepper,
and a splash of lemon juice. Serve in lettuce wraps or eat as-is.

